'Covered product' means any of the following products, including any of the products' components:
(a)  Aqueous film-forming foam;
(b)  Artificial  turf;
(c)  Cleaning products;
(d)  Carpets or rugs;
(e)  Cookware;
(f)  Cosmetics;
(g)  Dental floss;
(h)  Fabric treatments;
(i)  Packaging;
(j)  Juvenile products;
(k)  Menstrual products;
(L)  Refrigerators;
(m)  Textile articles; or
(n)  Ski wax.
(o)  Outdoor apparel for severe wet conditions.
